■ Upload to GitHub
# Step 1 — Initialize git
git init
git add .
git commit -m "Moner Bondhu AI Chatbot"
# Step 2 — Create repo at https://github.com
# Then connect and push:
git remote add origin YOUR_GITHUB_REPO_LINK
git branch -M main
git push -u origin main
■■ Add .gitignore before pushing! See 08_gitignore.pdf
■ Deploy Online for Free
Recommended platform: https://render.com
Other options: Railway (railway.app), Vercel (vercel.com)
On Render:
1. Connect your GitHub repository
2. Set Build Command: npm install
3. Set Start Command: node server.js
4. Add environment variable: GEMINI_API_KEY = your key
5. Click Deploy — your chatbot is live!
